```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>JARVIS AI</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #050505;
      color: white;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .jarvis {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .status {
      color: #00eaff;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .orb {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 3px solid #00eaff;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 20px #00eaff,
        0 0 50px #006eff,
        inset 0 0 30px #00eaff;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    .orb span {
      font-size: 50px;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% {
        transform: scale(1);
      }

      50% {
        transform: scale(1.08);
      }
    }

    .response {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 80px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #222;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: #0d0d0d;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .mic {
      margin-top: 25px;
      width: 75px;
      height: 75px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: none;
      background: #00aaff;
      color: white;
      font-size: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px #00aaff;
    }

    .mic:active {
      transform: scale(0.9);
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="jarvis">

    <h1>JARVIS</h1>

    <div class="status" id="status">
      SYSTEM ONLINE
    </div>

    <div class="orb">
      <span>◉</span>
    </div>

    <div class="response" id="response">
      Hello! I am JARVIS. Tap the microphone.
    </div>

    <button class="mic" onclick="startListening()">
      🎤
    </button>

  </div>

  <script>

    function startListening() {

      document.getElementById("status").innerText =
        "LISTENING...";

      document.getElementById("response").innerText =
        "I am listening...";

    }

  </script>

</body>
</html>
```